  "title": "FM27 Install-Path Checker — Where Each Mod Actually Goes",
  "description": "Pick your platform and what you are installing — real-name fix, faces, logos, kits or a skin — and get the exact folder, the backup step and the caveat for FM27.",
  "h1": "FM27 install-path checker",
  "meta": "Updated 13 November 2026 · Paths read from the maintainers' own installation pages on 13 November 2026 · Files are not hosted here.",
  "body": "<p><strong>Pick what you are installing and which platform you are on, and this gives you the folder, the backup step and the one caveat that matters.</strong> The answers come from the maintainers' own installation pages, read on 13 November 2026. This site does not host the files.</p>\n<div class=\"tool\" id=\"install-check\">\n  <form class=\"tool-form\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    <div class=\"tool-field\">\n      <label for=\"ic-what\">What are you installing?</label>\n      <select id=\"ic-what\">\n        <option value=\"rnf\">Real Name Fix (database folders)</option>\n        <option value=\"faces\">Player faces / facepack</option>\n        <option value=\"logos\">Logo pack</option>\n        <option value=\"kits\">2D kitpack</option>\n        <option value=\"skin-folder\">Skin — club folder, skins directory</option>\n        <option value=\"skin-bundle\">Skin — bundle replacement</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tool-field\">\n      <label for=\"ic-platform\">Platform</label>\n      <select id=\"ic-platform\">\n        <option value=\"win-steam\">Windows — Steam</option>\n        <option value=\"win-gamepass\">Windows — Xbox / Game Pass</option>\n        <option value=\"win-epic\">Windows — Epic</option>\n        <option value=\"mac-steam\">macOS — Steam</option>\n        <option value=\"mac-epic\">macOS — Epic</option>\n        <option value=\"steam-deck\">Steam Deck</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"tool-out\" id=\"ic-out\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n</div>\n<h2>Answer, per combination</h2>\n<p>If the checker above is not enough — or scripting is off — this is the same information as a table. Paths are the ones the maintainers publish; if your install is in a custom library, the earlier folders change and the tail stays the same.</p>\n<table>\n<thead><tr><th>Installing</th><th>Windows Steam</th><th>macOS Steam</th><th>Other editions</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>Real Name Fix v6</td><td><code>Steam/steamapps/common/Football Manager 27/shared/data/database/db</code> — copy <code>dbc</code>, <code>edt</code>, <code>lnc</code> into all eight <code>2X00</code> folders</td><td><code>~/Library/Application Support/Steam/steamapps/common/Football Manager 27/fm.app/Contents/PlugIns/game_plugin.bundle/Contents/Resources/shared/data/database/db</code></td><td>Game Pass: <code>XboxGames/Football Manager 27/shared/data/database/db</code>; Epic: <code>Epic Games/FootballManager27/shared/data/database/db</code></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Faces / logos / 2D kits</td><td><code>Documents\\Sports Interactive\\Football Manager 27\\graphics</code></td><td><code>~/Library/Application Support/Sports Interactive/Football Manager 27/graphics</code></td><td>Game Pass: <code>Documents\\Sports Interactive\\Football Manager 27\\Gamepass\\graphics</code></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Skin — club folder</td><td><code>Documents\\Sports Interactive\\Football Manager 27\\skins</code>, then Preferences → Quick settings</td><td><code>~/Library/Application Support/Sports Interactive/Football Manager 27/skins</code>, then Preferences → Quick settings</td><td>No published Game Pass or Epic path; the skins folder follows the user-data directory</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Skin — bundle replacement</td><td><code>Football Manager 27\\fm_Data\\StreamingAssets\\aa\\StandaloneWindows64\\</code></td><td><code>Football Manager 27/fm.app/Contents/Resources/Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneOSX/</code></td><td>Back up the three <code>ui-*.bundle</code> files before replacing anything</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>The four rules that prevent most broken installs</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Database files and graphics files never share a folder.</strong> The Real Name Fix goes into the game's install directory; faces, logos and kits go into your user-data <code>graphics</code> folder.</li>\n<li><strong>One change at a time.</strong> Install, launch, check a screen you know, then install the next thing.</li>\n<li><strong>Back up what you overwrite.</strong> For bundle replacements that is the only rollback that survives a patch.</li>\n<li><strong>A club-folder skin uninstalls itself</strong> — pick the previous skin in Preferences → Quick settings. A bundle replacement does not, so keep the originals.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Sources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href='https://sortitoutsi.net/content/78047/fm27-real-name-fix'>sortitoutsi: FM27 Real Name Fix — per-platform database paths and the eight folders</a></li>\n<li><a href='https://sortitoutsi.net/graphics/style/1/cut-out-player-faces'>sortitoutsi: Cut-Out Player Faces Megapack — graphics folder and Mac note</a></li>\n<li><a href='https://www.tcmlogos.com/tcm27-logos-fm27/'>TCMLogos: TCM27 — graphics path and the Game Pass variant</a></li>\n<li><a href='https://sortitoutsi.net/content/78064/super-league-turkey-fm27-skin'>sortitoutsi: Super League Turkey FM27 Skin — skins folder and bundle paths</a></li>\n</ul>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var data = {\n    \"rnf\": {\n      \"label\": \"Real Name Fix v6\",\n      \"what\": \"Copy the dbc, edt and lnc folders into every 2X00 database folder. v6 ships blank placeholders, so you overwrite instead of deleting the old fake-name files.\",\n      \"backup\": \"Copy the eight database folders somewhere safe first. Copying into only one folder is the most common mistake.\",\n      \"caveat\": \"Arsenal's unlicensed players are not fixed by this and need the separate FM27 Data Update.\",\n      \"paths\": {\n        \"win-steam\": \"Steam\\steamapps\\common\\Football Manager 27\\shared\\data\\database\\db\",\n        \"win-gamepass\": \"XboxGames\\Football Manager 27\\shared\\data\\database\\db\",\n        \"win-epic\": \"Epic Games\\FootballManager27\\shared\\data\\database\\db\",\n        \"mac-steam\": \"~/Library/Application Support/Steam/steamapps/common/Football Manager 27/fm.app/Contents/PlugIns/game_plugin.bundle/Contents/Resources/shared/data/database/db\",\n        \"mac-epic\": \"~/Library/Application Support/Epic/FootballManager2027/fm.app/Contents/PlugIns/game_plugin.bundle/Contents/Resources/shared/data/database/db\",\n        \"steam-deck\": \"steamapps/common/Football Manager 27/shared/data/database/db\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"faces\": {\n      \"label\": \"Player faces / facepack\",\n      \"what\": \"Put the face folders straight inside the graphics folder, with no extra wrapper folder, and let an update pack overwrite the previous config file.\",\n      \"backup\": \"Keep the 2027.00 base if you are applying the 2027.01 change pack, so you can rebuild the set.\",\n      \"caveat\": \"The pack's Mac instructions still say they are awaiting feedback from Mac users; the Windows instructions are the well-trodden path.\",\n      \"paths\": {\n        \"win-steam\": \"Documents\\Sports Interactive\\Football Manager 27\\graphics\",\n        \"win-gamepass\": \"Documents\\Sports Interactive\\Football Manager 27\\Gamepass\\graphics\",\n        \"win-epic\": \"Documents\\Sports Interactive\\Football Manager 27\\graphics\",\n        \"mac-steam\": \"~/Library/Application Support/Sports Interactive/Football Manager 27/graphics\",\n        \"mac-epic\": \"~/Library/Application Support/Sports Interactive/Football Manager 27/graphics\",\n        \"steam-deck\": \"Graphics folder inside the FM27 user-data directory\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"logos\": {\n      \"label\": \"Logo pack (TCM27)\",\n      \"what\": \"Put the Megapack TCM27 folder directly inside graphics, then quit and restart the game.\",\n      \"backup\": \"Remove any older logo pack first; two packs pointing at one club is a known cause of a blank badge.\",\n      \"caveat\": \"512px logos can look pixelated at Medium or Small display size. Set the display to Large, or install the TCM27.0 update.\",\n      \"paths\": {\n        \"win-steam\": \"Documents\\Sports Interactive\\Football Manager 27\\graphics\\Megapack TCM27\",\n        \"win-gamepass\": \"Documents\\Sports Interactive\\Football Manager 27\\Gamepass\\graphics\\Megapack TCM27\",\n        \"win-epic\": \"Documents\\Sports Interactive\\Football Manager 27\\graphics\\Megapack TCM27\",\n        \"mac-steam\": \"~/Library/Application Support/Sports Interactive/Football Manager 27/graphics/Megapack TCM27\",\n        \"mac-epic\": \"~/Library/Application Support/Sports Interactive/Football Manager 27/graphics/Megapack TCM27\",\n        \"steam-deck\": \"graphics/Megapack TCM27 inside the FM27 user-data directory\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"kits\": {\n      \"label\": \"2D kitpack\",\n      \"what\": \"Keep the nation folders directly inside the pack's kits folder and place that inside graphics; do not add an extra kitpack/kits wrapper.\",\n      \"backup\": \"Record the pack's version — the publisher does not show a numbered version on the page.\",\n      \"caveat\": \"A 2D kitpack says nothing about 3D kits or interface mods.\",\n      \"paths\": {\n        \"win-steam\": \"Documents\\Sports Interactive\\Football Manager 27\\graphics\",\n        \"win-gamepass\": \"Documents\\Sports Interactive\\Football Manager 27\\Gamepass\\graphics\",\n        \"win-epic\": \"Documents\\Sports Interactive\\Football Manager 27\\graphics\",\n        \"mac-steam\": \"~/Library/Application Support/Sports Interactive/Football Manager 27/graphics\",\n        \"mac-epic\": \"~/Library/Application Support/Sports Interactive/Football Manager 27/graphics\",\n        \"steam-deck\": \"Graphics folder inside the FM27 user-data directory\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"skin-folder\": {\n      \"label\": \"Skin — club folder\",\n      \"what\": \"Copy the whole club folder, the one holding skin.json, into the skins folder, then choose it under Preferences → Quick settings and accept the reload prompt.\",\n      \"backup\": \"None needed: selecting the previous skin in the same menu is the rollback, because no game files were changed.\",\n      \"caveat\": \"Some club packs are published with structural validation only — the authors say they have not been claimed as in-game tested.\",\n      \"paths\": {\n        \"win-steam\": \"Documents\\Sports Interactive\\Football Manager 27\\skins\",\n        \"win-gamepass\": \"Documents\\Sports Interactive\\Football Manager 27\\Gamepass\\skins\",\n        \"win-epic\": \"Documents\\Sports Interactive\\Football Manager 27\\skins\",\n        \"mac-steam\": \"~/Library/Application Support/Sports Interactive/Football Manager 27/skins\",\n        \"mac-epic\": \"~/Library/Application Support/Sports Interactive/Football Manager 27/skins\",\n        \"steam-deck\": \"skins folder inside the FM27 user-data directory\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"skin-bundle\": {\n      \"label\": \"Skin — bundle replacement\",\n      \"what\": \"Replace ui-mainmenu-assets_assets_all.bundle, ui-styles_assets_default.bundle and ui-tactics_assets_all.bundle, keeping the original filenames.\",\n      \"backup\": \"Copy all three original bundles out first. This is the only rollback that still works after a game patch.\",\n      \"caveat\": \"A bundle package does not appear under Preferences → Quick settings, and a skins-folder package does nothing in StreamingAssets.\",\n      \"paths\": {\n        \"win-steam\": \"Football Manager 27\\fm_Data\\StreamingAssets\\aa\\StandaloneWindows64\",\n        \"win-gamepass\": \"Football Manager 27\\fm_Data\\StreamingAssets\\aa\\StandaloneWindows64\",\n        \"win-epic\": \"Football Manager 27\\fm_Data\\StreamingAssets\\aa\\StandaloneWindows64\",\n        \"mac-steam\": \"Football Manager 27/fm.app/Contents/Resources/Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneOSX\",\n        \"mac-epic\": \"Football Manager 27/fm.app/Contents/Resources/Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneOSX\",\n        \"steam-deck\": \"Football Manager 27/fm_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64 (Proton)\"\n      }\n    }\n  };\n\n  var what = document.getElementById(\"ic-what\");\n  var platform = document.getElementById(\"ic-platform\");\n  var out = document.getElementById(\"ic-out\");\n  if (!what || !platform || !out) return;\n\n  function esc(s) {\n    return String(s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g, function (c) {\n      return { \"&\": \"&amp;\", \"<\": \"&lt;\", \">\": \"&gt;\", \"\"\": \"&quot;\" }[c];\n    });\n  }\n\n  function render() {\n    var d = data[what.value];\n    var p = d.paths[platform.value];\n    out.innerHTML =\n      \"<p class=\\\"tool-out-label\\\">\" + esc(d.label) + \"</p>\" +\n      \"<p class=\\\"tool-out-path\\\"><code>\" + esc(p) + \"</code></p>\" +\n      \"<p><strong>Then:</strong> \" + esc(d.what) + \"</p>\" +\n      \"<p><strong>Back up first:</strong> \" + esc(d.backup) + \"</p>\" +\n      \"<p class=\\\"tool-out-caveat\\\"><strong>Watch out:</strong> \" + esc(d.caveat) + \"</p>\";\n  }\n\n  what.addEventListener(\"change\", render);\n  platform.addEventListener(\"change\", render);\n  render();\n})();\n</script>",
